This package redistributes bundled TypeScript declarations from:

mongodb 7.7.0
https://github.com/mongodb/node-mongodb-native
Licensed under Apache-2.0; see licenses/mongodb-LICENSE.md.

bson 7.3.3
https://github.com/mongodb/js-bson
Licensed under Apache-2.0; see licenses/bson-LICENSE.md.

Changes: the declarations are bundled into ESM and CommonJS type entry points.
Imports between the upstream declarations are resolved within the type bundle.
The MongoDB driver and BSON JavaScript implementations are not distributed.
